& [Delineation] is one pure commitment transform
  + [inside] strict plan, complete assembly consumption and retention, current observation validation, assembly correlation checks, canonical byte streaming, SHA-256 finalization, output-only wrapper, bounded faults, tests, evidence, and rollback
  + [outside] physical observation, enumeration, completeness, traversal, Git reconciliation, repeated inventory, temporal claim, receipt issuance, admission, mutation, seal, execution effect, cleanup, and promotion
